meta {
  name: Widget Recommend (Conversational AI Chat)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/widget/recommend
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Manikan-Key: {{apiKey}}
  Origin: http://localhost:3000
}

body:json {
  {
    "session_id": "sess_abc123xyz789",
    "messages": [
      { "role": "user", "content": "My measurements: height 178cm, weight 75kg, chest 96cm, waist 82cm, hips 98cm. What size should I get?" }
    ],
    "betas": {
      "height_cm": 178,
      "weight_kg": 75,
      "chest_cm": 96,
      "waist_cm": 82,
      "hips_cm": 98
    },
    "product_id": "{{productId}}",
    "product_name": "Classic Cotton Shirt",
    "selected_category": "shirt",
    "intent": "size_recommendation"
  }
}

docs {
  ## POST /api/widget/recommend

  **Conversational AI Chat Proxy.** Powers the embeddable recommendation widget's
  chat interface. Proxies to the LangGraph-orchestrated FastAPI recommendation service.

  ### Key Server-Side Enrichments (never from client)
  - **`size_chart`** — fetched from Prisma by `product_id` (prevents chart fabrication)
  - **`retailer_id`** — resolved from the API key (prevents cross-tenant data leakage)
  - **`profile_context`** — authenticated customer's saved measurements & fit history
  - **`available_categories/brands`** — scoped to this retailer's active products only

  ### Body (key fields)
  | Field              | Type     | Required | Description                                               |
  |--------------------|----------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
  | session_id         | string   | ✅       | Unique conversation session ID (UUIDv4 recommended)       |
  | messages           | array    | ✅       | Chat history `[{ role, content }]`                        |
  | betas              | object   | ❌       | User measurements `{ height_cm, weight_kg, chest_cm, ... }` |
  | product_id         | string   | ❌       | Product the shopper is viewing (enables size chart fetch) |
  | product_name       | string   | ❌       | Display name for context                                  |
  | selected_category  | string   | ❌       | Category hint for the agent                               |
  | intent             | string   | ❌       | `"size_recommendation"`, `"product_search"`, etc.         |
  | shown_product_ids  | string[] | ❌       | IDs already shown (avoids repetition)                     |
  | catalog_products   | array    | ❌       | Client-side product cache the agent may reference         |

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "reply": "Based on your measurements, I recommend size **L**...",
    "recommended_size": "L",
    "confidence_score": 0.92,
    "explanation": "Your chest (96cm) fits within the L range (94–100cm).",
    "provider": "STATIC-CALC"
  }
  ```

  ### Static Fit-Range Short-Circuit
  If the last user message matches sizing phrases (e.g. "what size fits me",
  "use my saved measurements"), the route may resolve deterministically via
  local `assessFitRange()` WITHOUT calling the LLM — faster and cheaper.
}
